yCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7622046644,"name":"Monster Ghoul(MOBILE/PC)[2X EXP][FIXED STAT][BETA]","desc":"Welcome to Monster Ghoul, an immersive experience where your choices shape your destiny. In this thrilling universe, you are invited to choose your allegiance:\n will you walk the path of the Ghouls or align yourself with the CCG (Commission of Counter Ghoul).\n\n\nFAQ\n\n-Killing player with high level could possibly earn high reputation\n\nFor computers press 1 to 9 to use your kagune/quinque \n\n\"V\" - Quinx or Arata Joker\n\"X\" - Sprint\n\n\n⚠️XBOX is still beta⚠️\n\nXBOX CONTROLER LIST👇\n\nHold L2 + Square = E\n\nHold L2 + Triangle = R\n\nHold L2 + Cycle = F \n\nHold L2 + X = C\n\nHold L2 + L1 = V\n\nHoldL2 + Up Button = Switch Detahcments/QuinX\n\nR2 = normal click\n\nR1 = dash\n\nUp button = Sprint\n\nDown button = shiftlock\n\nLeft button = N (Equip Arata)\n\nRight button = Mask\n\n\nNormal X = Jump\n\n\nDo not attempt to exploit the system, as our auto-detection will identify such actions, and we do not entertain appeals for bans.","path":"/game/7622046644-monster-ghoul","slug":"7622046644-monster-ghoul","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4da21cd7ef28c825752cc538f002f629ae0e5058f3f3321f69d3da013f0f379e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1606aa35295af445a149b98d7008ceca/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":38334193,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-09-26T02:14:48.024Z","creator":{"name":"iBlackButterfly","type":"User"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8122028632,"name":"RHGT","desc":"\"REALISTIC HOOD GUN TEST\"\n\nPC/MOBILE/TABLET/XBOX/PLAYSTATION SUPPORTED","path":"/game/8122028632-rhgt","slug":"8122028632-rhgt","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b852672c7b6e071ee74ab4fba18c5e25e548aeaccfa3af40109e0282459c0ee9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d1a1b488ad76bebefde4d03155eb18a8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":27141099,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-20T14:46:11.202Z","creator":{"name":"NocturnallyPoisoned","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7703947631,"name":"Akumu [Horror]","desc":"Today, we are starting to revamp the whole Akumu game with a new name and stories. \r\nI will appreciate your patience with a new major update. Join our community server to see more announcements soon!\r\n\r\nA traditional folktale that deceived many into believing immortality was possible to achieve. A doomed man who instead summoned \"Her\". Venture into the woods and find out the horrifying truth to this folktale.\r\n\r\nJoin our community through the Social links\r\n\r\nThis game is inspired by The Mimic\r\n\r\nTags: Geisha, Samurai, Mimic, Horror, Survival, Ghost, Spirit, Evil, Scary, Multiplayer Horror, Monox","path":"/game/7703947631-akumu","slug":"7703947631-akumu","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2d39537caf3323765710dfb45f2104eb478785ed0b8fe7e7dfaccd78a0d660c9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-315b73fcfc0b86af6ce2844ea9ada1bf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":20244074,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-19T09:30:04.314Z","creator":{"name":"Kursed Incorporated","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8479386309,"name":"Egg Hunt 2022: Lost in Time","desc":"Welcome to your grand journey, great eggventurer! Upon finding a mysterious crystal in a cavern, you unknowingly unleash a great evil that threatens not only the jungle, but the entire timeline. Will you be able to take on the challenges ahead in order to conquer your journey victoriously?\n\nTake on the pesky rabbit Hopper as you traverse through the jungle; helping the residents, peculiar animals, and locating every last egg to power an advanced device & take back the timeline from chaotic madness!\n\nThis passionate project would not have been achieved without the creative inspiration from Egg Hunt 2018: The Great Yolktales, developed by the talented Fifteam.\n\nThis is a community-developed unofficial Egg Hunt experience, all egg rewards are in-experience ONLY and will NOT be reflected in your Inventory. We appreciate your understanding. Happy hunting! 🐇\n\n\nAnimation - DeepAquaticBlue\nScripting - DeepAquaticBlue & Programmables\nGame Producer - DeepAquaticBlue & InnovationTime\n","path":"/game/8479386309-egg-hunt-2022-lost-in-time","slug":"8479386309-egg-hunt-2022-lost-in-time","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c699a0dd6794ee4989fd631503204940577cc1075816bd989620a2d297849fee.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6fe2b71bfa61fd8a5eadc487d40e5813/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":2216741,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-05-28T05:40:08.415Z","creator":{"name":"Egg Hunt 2022: Lost in Time","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7581823123,"name":"Tile Game Ultimate [MARBLES]","desc":"Welcome to 🦑 Tile Game Ultimate 🦑 Parkour your way through the glass tiles to get to the very end! You can also roleplay as many different characters. With a cash prize that increases for every death, do you think you can reach the end and win?\n\n📋 Update Log\n-Throw a marble to determine if a tile can be stepped on or not (VIPs get 1 extra marble)\n-Special tile tracker gamepass\n-Number of wins before a reset has been nearly doubled\n\n🏆 Premium Roblox users get 5,000 cash upon joining and a 1.1x cash multiplier 🏆\n🛡️ Group Members get 5,000 bonus cash 🛡️\n\nIf you enjoy this game, be sure to play other games, like Fish Game, Hexa Game, Red Light Green Light, Squid Obby, 99% Fail, and many more.","path":"/game/7581823123-tile-game-ultimate","slug":"7581823123-tile-game-ultimate","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a22f50550b22feeba2c29f08bb1653a9a7a8719ef90c1f2c4c54e3d679bf8132.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1b040f7c3171c59258ee33fd3761f6e5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"